## Layout
```
ansible.cfg
collections/requirements.yml
inventory/aws_ec2.yml
group_vars/all.yml          # your values (this environment)
playbooks: site.yml, preflight.yml
roles/  vpc, security_groups, bastion, alb, asg_app, rds
```

## Run
```bash
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install ansible boto3 botocore
ansible-galaxy collection install -r collections/requirements.yml
aws configure                                   # credentials for {{ aws_region }}

ansible-playbook preflight.yml                  # checks creds + variables
ansible-playbook site.yml --check               # dry run
ansible-playbook site.yml                        # provision
```

> Roles are starter implementations — review `group_vars/all.yml` and harden before production use.
> Secrets (DB password, etc.) belong in `ansible-vault`, not in plain `group_vars`.
